on the outskirts of the city to be re-buried. Despite all his torturing and murdering, Franco still has fans in Spain. Some see him as the emblem of a traditional Spanish Catholic life, and some actually like his fascist ideology and would like to see it make a comeback. And so when his body was removed, hundreds of his supporters gathered at the new cemetery to wheel swastikers and Franco era flags and to perform the fascist salute in his honor. In fact, I lived 19 years under Franco and Spain was a wonderful country. Now it's a shit.
在城市郊区重新安葬。尽管他犯下了种种酷刑和谋杀罪行，佛朗哥在西班牙仍有拥护者。有些人视他为西班牙传统天主教生活的象征，还有些人确实喜欢他的法西斯意识形态，并希望看到它卷土重来。因此，当他的遗体被移走时，数百名支持者聚集在新墓地，挥舞着纳粹标志和佛朗哥时代的旗帜，并以法西斯礼向他致敬。事实上，我在佛朗哥统治下生活了19年，西班牙曾是一个美好的国家。现在它烂透了。

