00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:40.000
What began as a military coup that had almost three years of civil war? The right-wingers gradually seized control of Spain. Their death squads rounded up suspected leftists and then paraded them through villages and shot them. For both sides, political opponents became enemies to be hunted down and killed. This is purification on La Peña, her grandfather Manuel and great uncle Antonio were among Franco's victims.
这场始于军事政变的行动演变成了近三年的内战。右翼分子逐渐夺取了西班牙的控制权。他们的死亡小队搜捕疑似左翼分子，将他们游街示众并枪决。对双方而言，政治对手都成了必须被追捕和杀害的敌人。这是普里菲卡·佩尼亚（Purificación La Peña），她的祖父曼努埃尔和叔祖父安东尼奥都是佛朗哥的受害者。

