00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:52.000
Some contained thousands of bodies. It's estimated that Spain still has 114,000 missing people dating back to that time. But Franco wasn't interested in what happened to the bodies of his enemies, at least not at first. He was too busy consolidating his power. As the great superpowers of the world took up sides in World War II, he decided not to fight, focusing his energies on fully crushing his
有些坑里埋着数千具尸体。据估计，西班牙至今仍有11.4万人失踪，可以追溯到那个时期。但佛朗哥对敌人的尸体下落并不感兴趣，至少起初是这样。他忙于巩固自己的权力。当世界超级大国在第二次世界大战中选边站时，他决定不参战，将精力集中在彻底粉碎国内的

