opposition at home. In an official declaration, Generalissimo Francisco Franco states that his government will not join the German Italian-Japanese alliance against communism. But he says that he will extrope communism in Spain. The country now had a single political party and protest was effectively banned. Franco became known as El Caldillo, the supreme leader. And in a very savvy move, he continued to cultivate the backing of the Catholic Church. Franco was not a particularly religious man, but he adopted the idea very cleverly that his war efforts was a religious crusade.
反对派上。在官方声明中，弗朗西斯科·佛朗哥大元帅表示，他的政府不会加入德意日反共联盟。但他表示，他将在西班牙铲除共产主义。该国现在只有一个政党，抗议活动实际上被禁止。佛朗哥被称为“领袖”（El Caudillo）。他采取了一个非常精明的举措，继续培养天主教会的支持。佛朗哥并不是一个特别虔诚的人，但他非常聪明地采纳了一个观点，即他的战争努力是一场宗教十字军东征。

14
00:07:35.000 --> 00:08:08.000
This is Paul Preston. He's one of the leading scholars of the Spanish Civil War and of Franco's regime. And this guaranteed him the support of the Catholic Church internationally. Which meant Franco could operate with relative impunity. He went about taking away many of the rights that Spaniards had gained during the 1930s. Women, for example, lost the right to divorce their husbands and have abortions and they could no longer work outside the home without permission. Men, on the other hand, could kill their wives for adultery.
这是保罗·普雷斯顿。他是研究西班牙内战和佛朗哥政权的顶尖学者之一。这保证了他获得国际天主教会的支持，意味着佛朗哥可以相对不受惩罚地行事。他着手剥夺了西班牙人在20世纪30年代获得的多项权利。例如，女性失去了与丈夫离婚和堕胎的权利，未经许可不能在家庭外工作。另一方面，男性可以因妻子通奸而杀死她们。

15
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:38.000
The government banned regional languages like Basque and Catalan. The Catholic Church ruled over every aspect of most Spaniards lives. The ideas of francoism have been pumped out from church pulpits. They're being pumped out in schools, the people who in principle would not have supported Franco were basically forced either to accept these ideas or go into what we call inner exile, in other words, to go into a world of silence.
政府禁止了巴斯克语和加泰罗尼亚语等地区语言。天主教会统治着大多数西班牙人生活的方方面面。佛朗哥主义的思想从教堂讲坛中传出，在学校里灌输。那些原则上不支持佛朗哥的人基本上被迫要么接受这些思想，要么进入所谓的“内心流亡”，换句话说，进入一个沉默的世界。

