he was put to work in the office, suffering papers around for prison officials and filling in endless forms. But as he walked to and from his barracks each day, he saw men carving rock on pitiful rations of food and working with dynamite without protection. Very harsh work and obviously there were some people that were killed. The construction of the Valley of the Fallen took an enormous human toll.
他被安排在办公室工作，为监狱官员处理文件并填写无休止的表格。但每天往返营房时，他都会看到工人们在可怜的口粮下凿石，并在没有保护的情况下使用炸药。工作非常艰苦，显然有些人因此丧生。烈士谷的建设造成了巨大的人员伤亡。

