Franco went about making that happen in the most fascist way possible. Well, so Franco and I, well, we're going to do this as a reconciliation. What do you think about the opinion? That's the way possible. What if he got the idea? Says that Franco ordered his people to bring him bodies from mass graves and cemeteries all over Spain. They dug the bodies up without permission and jumbled them together in boxes.
佛朗哥以最法西斯的方式去实现这一目标。好吧，佛朗哥和我，我们要把这作为一种和解。你觉得这个意见怎么样？这是最可能的方式。他怎么会有这个想法？据说佛朗哥下令手下从西班牙各地的万人坑和墓地把尸体运来。他们未经许可就挖出尸体，把它们混在一起装进盒子里。

