Well, look, when Franco died, we were very happy to get rid of him. We were expecting that, and we had the freeze of full of champagne. The three years between Franco's death and the signing of a new constitution became known as the transition. The country moved from fascist dictatorship to multi-party democracy. And starting in the late 1970s, Spain finally got to do what the US, Britain and France had done more than a decade before. They got to have fun.
看，佛朗哥死的时候，我们很高兴摆脱了他。我们期待着那一刻，冰箱里都塞满了香槟。佛朗哥去世到签署新宪法之间的三年被称为“过渡期”。国家从法西斯独裁转向了多党民主。从20世纪70年代末开始，西班牙终于可以做美国、英国和法国十多年前做过的事了。他们可以享受生活了。

24
00:12:53.000 --> 00:13:43.000
A new revolutionary movement sprang up in Madrid and became known as La Movida, Madelineia. La Movida has consumed Madrid, transforming the capital into Europe's new, moveable feast. Suddenly, Spaniards could drink, dance, have sex outside of marriage, and make music about it. The transition seemed to have ushered in a new Spain, but the elation felt after Franco's death was temporary. It's only after several years that you realize that new democracy hasn't solved all the problems that were brought by the dictatorship. For one thing, there were reminders of the dictatorship everywhere. There were statues of Franco and his collaborators in central plaza all over the country.
一场新的革命运动在马德里兴起，被称为“莫维达”（La Movida）。“莫维达”席卷了马德里，将首都变成了欧洲新的“流动的盛宴”。突然间，西班牙人可以喝酒、跳舞、婚外性行为，并为此创作音乐。过渡期似乎开启了一个新的西班牙，但佛朗哥死后的狂喜是暂时的。几年后你才会意识到，新的民主并没有解决独裁统治带来的所有问题。首先，独裁统治的痕迹随处可见。全国各地的中心广场上都有佛朗哥及其合作者的雕像。

25
00:13:43.000 --> 00:14:27.000
His name was on street signs. And of course, the Valley of the Fallen served as a colossal reminder. How can you have a democracy and at the same time have a huge monument to the glory of the dictatorship built by political prisoners? But perhaps the biggest hurdle to fully addressing what had happened to the country under Franco was an agreement that became known as the pacto de la olvido, the pact of forgetting. It is simply an oblivion, an amnesty for everyone. Agreed to by everyone.
他的名字出现在街道标志上。当然，烈士谷作为一个巨大的提醒存在着。你怎么能既拥有民主，又同时拥有一座由政治犯建造的、歌颂独裁统治的巨大纪念碑呢？但也许全面解决佛朗哥统治下国家所发生之事的最大障碍，是一项被称为“遗忘协定”（Pacto del Olvido）的协议。这简直就是一种遗忘，一种对所有人的大赦。每个人都同意了。

